data: {"id": "54faf76846594368-thinking-parallel_evidence-1472", "run_id": "54faf76846594368", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已采集的真实工具事实，对 `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` 的 CrashLoopBackOff 根因分析如下：\n\n### 1. 已确认事实\n*   **异常状态确认**：Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。`kubectl_describe` 显示 `restarts=18`，kubelet 持续上报 `Back-off restarting failed container app` 警告。\n*   **崩溃直接原因**：容器进程异常退出，**退出码 (exitCode) 为 2**。这通常代表用户程序内部的致命错误或异常终止。\n*   **应用层证据**：\n    *   **Previous Logs**：崩溃前的最后一行日志明确记录 `\"event\": \"http_request\", \"message\": \"runtime process exiting\", \"http_status\": 500`，确认了进程是在处理请求时主动终止的。\n    *   **Tracing (Deepflow & Temp", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788788656138, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

