data: {"id": "54faf76846594368-final", "run_id": "54faf76846594368", "seq": 1477, "ts_ms": 1788788672663, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` | CrashLoopBackOff | 应用代码在处理 HTTP 请求 `/work` 时触发未捕获的致命错误，导致 Python 进程主动终止（exitCode=2），进而引发 Pod CrashLoopBackOff。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CrashLoopBackOff`, `exit_code`: 2 | 确认容器因代码逻辑终止（exitCode=2）陷入重启循环，直接锁定故障机制 |\n| 2 | Logging | elasticsearch | `http_request` 模式：路径 `/work`，`runtime process exiting`，`http_status: 500`，`occurrence_count: 4` | 记录到应用层致命错误日志，确认终止源于 `/work` 业务逻辑处理失败 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `BackOff`: `Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` (x316 over 72m) | 展现长期的重启震荡现象，佐证代码错误持续触发且未被自愈 |\n| 4 | Tracing | tempo/deepflow | `GET /work` 的 500 Span (`trace_id: cbadac50855f5a9fdc68ea695812457d`) 且 `aiops.observed_mode: runtime_exit`；伴随成功 200 请求 | 区分了代码崩溃与正常运行：崩溃请求表现为进程退出，而 `/work` 路径本身可成功（200），排除全量业务不可用 |\n\n证据表明 `workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` 的 Pod 持续重启。Tracing 中的 500 请求与日志中的 `runtime process exiting` 直接对应（同属 `/work` 路径），而 K8s 的 `exitCode=2` 证实了代码层面的未捕获异常。K8s 事件证实了这种崩溃导致的 BackOff 状态已持续数十分钟。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码在处理 HTTP 请求 `/work` 时触发未捕获的致命错误 → Python 进程主动终止（exitCode=2） → Kubernetes 容器因 exitCode=2 终止进入 CrashLoopBackOff → 用户发起 `/work` 请求时间歇性返回 500 且 Pod 持续重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因是 **应用代码在处理 `/work` 请求时触发未捕获的致命错误**（如 Python 异常或断言失败）。\n- 代码层面的未捕获异常导致 Python 进程以 `exitCode=2` 主动终止（证据 #1, #2）；\n- 终止事件被 K8s 容器运行时检测到，触发 Pod 自动重启，并因连续失败进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（证据 #1, #3）；\n- 用户可见现象为在 Pod 启动及重启间隙，访问 `/work` 路径时接收 HTTP 500 响应，并伴随频繁的 Pod 重启事件（证据 #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 93.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 93.7s (Evidence 87.7s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 124.637, "metrics": {"run_id": "54faf76846594368", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 124.64276218414307, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 124642.76218414307, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 80566.25247001648, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 67528.0704498291, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 43688.796520233154}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位",